vs-imageseqs third-party notices
================================

This distribution contains the vs-imageseqs VapourSynth plugin and native
code from the projects listed below. The files in LICENSES/ are part of the
distribution and preserve the applicable license texts and notices.

The exact native inputs recorded here are from the x64-windows-static-md
vcpkg installation used to build the Windows wheel. The Linux manylinux build
pins dav1d, libde265 and libwebp in `tools/build-manylinux.sh`; Cargo.lock
selects the embedded libheif and OpenJPEG sources. The macOS arm64 build uses
the same pinned dav1d and libde265 source versions, builds them as shared
libraries, bundles them, and disables unused libheif codec backends so
machine-local codecs are not linked:

  * libheif 1.23.1
  * libde265 1.1.1
  * dav1d 1.5.3
  * libwebp 1.6.0
  * OpenJPEG (vendored by openjpeg-sys 1.0.12)

The native dependency versions and license expressions used by this build
are recorded below. Rust crate licenses are intentionally out of scope for
this first notice bundle.

